        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-HEXACONTA.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-HEXACONTA-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH321-YI-64PHASE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH322-HEXAGRAM-ORTHO-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH323-ZERO-RIPPLE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH324-YI-SAAT-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH325-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-HEXACONTA-WIT       PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-HEXACONTA.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-HEXACONTA.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH321-YI-64PHASE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH322-HEXAGRAM-ORTHO-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH323-ZERO-RIPPLE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH324-YI-SAAT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH325-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-FPGA-HEXACONTA-WIT
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-FPGA-HEXACONTA-WIT.
